      "side": 1,
      "message": "This payload never comes from the network: it is the one the local client passes to sendTrustRequest(), which JamiAccount has already written whole to the requests cache, or that cache when the request is resent (onTrackedBuddyOnline). toMap() is a single linear pass over string_views and only runs above 16 KiB, so it costs no more than the copy and the disk write already done for the same bytes. I\u0027d rather keep a single size limit than add a second one that protects nothing.",
